# Local state from `supabase db start` / `supabase test db`, for both projects.
#
# These patterns contain a slash, so they are anchored to this file's directory
# and do NOT cover the catalog project underneath it -- hence the second pair
# rather than one rule that looks like it should already match.
#
# The nine files under supabase/.temp were tracked for a long time despite this
# rule, because .gitignore does not untrack what is already committed. They hold
# which project the CLI is linked to, so with three projects to switch between,
# every `supabase link` was rewriting files in the working tree. Untracked in the
# commit that added supabase-catalog/.
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp
supabase-catalog/supabase/.branches
supabase-catalog/supabase/.temp

# The Android signing key. Whoever holds this can publish an APK that installs
# over everyone's FamCart as an update, so it lives in the repo secrets and on
# whatever machine generated it — never here.
*.keystore
*.jks

# One-off export of the global catalog rows before they moved to the catalog
# project. The 256 'curated' rows in here have no other source: the seed script
# that wrote them was deleted in 9a4366e along with its products.json. Not
# committed -- it is data, not code -- but worth keeping off the machine too.
*.backup.json
